{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the numerical coefficients in the complete expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e198eb5e1e037c8d6c982e40f14d32506e600dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - 2xy + y^2)^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b67231e596999805cbbc785e1a4e6ed3e54c25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 7 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 14 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ 128 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ 128^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"426\" height=\"19\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the given equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e198eb5e1e037c8d6c982e40f14d32506e600dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - 2xy + y^2)^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" /> can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/8142d62b92150b0d2f347bb3f51edeacab471163.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y)^{14} = \\sum_{k=0}^{14} \\binom{14}{k}(-1)^k\\cdot x^{14-k}\\cdot y^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"300\" height=\"53\" />. \n</p><p>Notice that if we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/2961313d9872619a9f10419b469797e5abc30ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, then we are simply left with the sum of the coefficients from each term. Therefore, the sum of the coefficients is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabc50381d56b3e43d471642206f39dc109e2649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-1)^7 = 0, \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/w